cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this cataloguing system, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  IGIS Sources Catalog: система каталогизации историко-географических
  источников для построения исторических ГИС
type: dataset
version: "1.3"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
authors:
  - family-names: "Пуреховский"
    given-names: "Андрей Жоржевич"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4531-3516"
    affiliation: "Институт географии РАН"
  - family-names: "Алейников"
    given-names: "Алексей Александрович"
    affiliation: "Институт географии РАН"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PoohE/igis-sources-catalog"
keywords:
  - historical GIS
  - HGIS
  - cataloguing
  - metadata
  - historical maps
  - archives
  - analytical passport
  - Russia
abstract: >-
  A cataloguing system for historical-geographical sources (cartographic,
  textual, serial statistical) held in federal and regional archives and
  libraries of Russia, designed for building hierarchical historical GIS
  (guberniya - uezd - volost). Each item is described by 73 fields in four
  blocks, including the analytical passport of the source; the classification
  covers 24 source types in three classes (A1-C8) and is harmonised with
  ISAD(G), MARC 21, Dublin Core and ISO 19115. Supported by the Russian
  Science Foundation, grant 26-17-00347.
